# Every place on the road grid where a crossroads can still be built is kept
# for it, with a signpost (Y on the map): nothing else is built there, no
# field is sown there, and the menu Space opens there offers just the crossroads.
> new village
> map E28:-C100
        30        40        50        60        70        80        90        1
