> ride s0:83
  rider: s0:83 facing +
> menu
  build menu: intersection; chosen: intersection
> expect cannot build house at s0:82 kept for a crossroads
  ok: can't build house at s0:82: This place is kept for a crossroads
> expect cannot build farm at s0:79 kept for a crossroads
  ok: can't build farm at s0:79: This place is kept for a crossroads
# right up to it is fine
> ride s0:85
  rider: s0:85 facing +
> menu
  build menu: warehouse, house, farm, mill, bakery, blacksmith, market, chapel, tavern, watchtower, well, woodcutter, stonecutter; chosen: warehouse
> ride s0:83
  rider: s0:83 facing +
> menu
  build menu: intersection; chosen: intersection
> build crossroads here
  #81 intersection at s0:82-84, constructing
> expect at s0:82 crossroads constructing
  ok: #81 intersection at s0:82-84, constructing
> run until built
  all built after 14.5s
> expect streets 2
  ok: 2 streets
# its street has places of its own, every 27 cells along it
> streets
  s0  runs east (lots on its north side), cells 10..252
  s1  runs north (lots on its west side), cells 10..252, from crossroads #81
    crossroads #81: s0:83 = s1:131 (cell A83)
